    <text>
        <body>
            <div xml:id="d1133">

                <pb facs="1032" n="1020" sameAs="frus:frus1939v01/pg1020"/>

                <note rend="inline" type="source">704.60d61/3: Telegram</note>
                <head>
                    <hi rendition="#italic">The Ambassador in the Soviet Union</hi> (<hi
                        rendition="#italic">Steinhardt</hi>) <hi rendition="#italic">to the
                        Secretary of State </hi>
                </head>
                <opener>
                    <dateline rendition="#float-right">
                        <placeName>
                            <hi rendition="#small-caps">Moscow</hi></placeName>, <date
                            calendar="gregorian" when="1939-12-03T16:00:00+03:00">December 3, 1939—4
                            p.m.</date>
                        <lb/> [Received December 3—1:05 p.m.]</dateline>
                </opener>
                <p>1009. The Finnish Minister recognizes that his request made through me concerning
                    the representation of Finnish interests in Moscow by this Embassy has been
                    annulled by the action of the Swedish Government reported in my 998, December 2,
                    5 p.m., and 999, December 2, 6 p.m.<anchor n="15" xml:id="d1133-f1"/> Moreover,
                    in view of the recognition by the Soviet Government of the “Kuusinen government”
                    and the conclusion of a formal treaty with that government it is improbable that
                    any third <pb facs="1033" n="1021" xml:id="pg1021"/> power will be permitted to
                    take over Finnish interests and that in consequence the Swedish request will be
                    refused.</p>
                <p>I have advised the Finnish Minister that if at any time we can informally be of
                    assistance to the Swedish Minister I will be glad to cooperate.</p>
                <closer>
                    <signed>
                        <hi rendition="#small-caps">Steinhardt</hi>
                    </signed>
                </closer>
            </div>
        </body>
    </text>
